-- Destination translations: every published atoll (incl. Male City),
-- island, dive site and attraction (location rows of type atoll/island/
-- dive_site/poi) into all 6 rolled-out languages (de/es/it/ru/ja/zh),
-- powering the new /{locale}/maldives/{atolls,islands,dive-sites,
-- attractions}/[slug]/ routes. Atolls, islands and dive sites follow the
-- same sentence skeleton as their English summaries (one per English
-- template -- inhabited/resort/plain island, reef/thila/channel/wreck/cave
-- dive site), with place names kept in their real Latin-script form and
-- the same English slug; Male City and all 17 attractions are
-- hand-translated, and attractions carry their full translated body in
-- `description` (read by getTranslatedAttractionBySlug) under a localized
-- slug. Already applied directly against the live DB; this file keeps a
-- from-scratch replay in sync.
on conflict (entity_id, locale) do update set
  slug = excluded.slug, title = excluded.title, short_description = excluded.short_description, description = excluded.description,
  body_html = excluded.body_html, meta_title = excluded.meta_title, meta_description = excluded.meta_description,
  translation_status = excluded.translation_status, translated_by = excluded.translated_by, updated_at = now();
